{
  "about": "Golden questions for the shopping assistant and the panels' work assistant (hallucination prevention, layer 5). Run them with scripts/evaluate-assistant.ps1 against the real model and the local seed data. Every case checks the LAST answer of its conversation; login: true = chat as the seed customer customer1, login: \"<email>\" = chat as that seed account (vendor1, delivery1, admin, customer2); emptyCartFirst: true = empty that account's cart before the conversation (the cart cases chat as customer2, so customer1's cart stays as it is). Checks: tools = at least one of these tools was used; noTools = no tool was used; contains = every text must appear; containsAny = at least one must appear; notContains = none may appear; grounded = expected value of the grounded flag. Texts are compared without upper/lower case. Only facts that the seed data keeps stable are checked (stock changes with every order, so stock is never checked word for word).",
